BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:CREATOR'S DEN CABARET
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261121T200000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261121T213000
DTSTAMP:20260729T191855Z
UID:occ-8463@atlcal.com
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Variety & Cabaret
DESCRIPTION:A returning group of women singers with a cabaret set devoted 
 to the women and music of the 1970s.\n\nA cabaret built around the women o
 f 1970s music\, sung by a group of women making a return engagement. Prese
 nted as part of Out of Box Theatre's Creator's Den series\, which hosts ou
 tside artists in the company's black box space.
GEO:33.9148699;-84.3601692
LAST-MODIFIED:20260729T154224Z
LOCATION:Out of Box Theatre\, 585 Cobb Pkwy SE\, Suite G-1
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://www.zeffy.com/en-US/ticketing/cabaret-at-the-den-series
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Twas The Night Before...
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261202T193000
DTSTAMP:20260729T191855Z
UID:occ-8426@atlcal.com
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Variety & Cabaret
DESCRIPTION:Cirque du Soleil's first-ever holiday show\, an acrobatic spin
  on the classic Christmas poem\, built for families.\n\nCirque du Soleil t
 akes on the classic poem 'Twas the Night Before Christmas\, the company's 
 first-ever holiday production. Expect the troupe's signature acrobatics be
 nt toward Christmas: a family show built around generosity\, friendship\, 
 and a houseful of oddball characters. Presented as part of the Fox Theatre
 's holiday programming.
GEO:33.7726136;-84.3853395
LAST-MODIFIED:20260729T154214Z
LOCATION:Fox Theatre\, 660 Peachtree St NE
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://foxtheatre.evenue.net/cgi-bin/ncommerce3/SEGetGroupList?groupC
 ode=TWA&linkID=fta&shopperContext=&caller=&appCode=
END:VEVENT
